evidence:
  crash_line: "Installed router_process_lifecycle.py:253 = raise RuntimeError('ciel-runtime router did not start. See {log_path}') after the 30 s router_up wait."
  router_log: "C:\\Users\\aapw-a24u24\\AppData\\Roaming\\ciel-runtime\\router-instances\\9779-651d879f6c68\\router.log (last write 2026-10-02 17:28 local): the router child dies at import with 'RuntimeError: ciel-runtime port 9779 is reserved by workspace c:\\programdata\\aap-win\\sandboxes\\u24\\home\\kobe-ai; choose a different CIEL_RUNTIME_ROUTER_PORT for c:\\programdata\\aap-win\\sandboxes\\u24\\root\\qb' (workspace_router_selection._claim_explicit_port)."
